    "sections": {
        "description": "SPA and Wellness Centre Theme provides a structured layout for presenting spa, wellness, and health-related services online. Its design can include sections for treatments, service descriptions, pricing details, appointment information, testimonials, and contact details. The homepage layout can be organized into distinct content areas to help visitors navigate available information. The SPA and Wellness Centre Theme supports responsive layouts, allowing pages to adapt to desktop, tablet, and mobile screen sizes. Customizable colors, typography, menus, and page sections provide options for adjusting the visual presentation to match different branding requirements. Content areas can be used to describe services offered by wellness centres, including massage treatments, relaxation programs, and personal care services. Separate sections can present information for wellness retreat centres or holistic health centres, including schedules, facilities, and contact details. The SPA and Wellness Centre Theme can also accommodate pages for yoga studios, meditation centres, and fitness and wellness centres. Its layout supports organized service presentation while keeping essential information such as operating hours, location, and booking details accessible."
    },
